==Game data==
===NPC appearances===
*If the player chose {{p|Squirtle}}, the player's [[rival]], {{ga|Blue}}, will pick Bulbasaur in [[Generation I]] and {{g|FireRed and LeafGreen}}. Blue will use this Bulbasaur in his first three battles against the player before it evolves into {{p|Ivysaur}}.
*[[Professor Sycamore]] will use a Bulbasaur in his first battle against the player in {{g|X and Y}}.
*{{g|Pokopia}}: Bulbasaur is the second Pokémon {{poko|Ditto}} befriends, and the first Pokémon to appear in a restored [[Habitat Dex|habitat]]. It teaches Ditto how to use {{m|Leafage}}.

